    "name": "Api Routes",
    "description": "It contains manual testing of API routes.\n\n- POST /api/:workspaceId : use to create API in specific workspace\n    \n- GET /api/:workspaceId/:apiId : use to get specific API from specific Workspace\n    \n- GET /api/:workspaceId : used to get API list of specific workspace\n    \n- PATCH /api/:workspaceId/:apiId : used to update specific API of specific workspace\n    \n- DELETE /api/:workspaceId/:apiId : used to delete specific API from specific workspace",
